                                        박승민
                                    </div>
                                </td>
                                <td>2024.01.28</td>
                                <td>521</td>
                                <td>45</td>
                            </tr>

                            <!-- 일반 게시글 -->
                            <tr>
                                <td>25</td>
                                <td>
                                    <a href="#" class="text-dark text-left d-block">
                                        새로 구매한 등산스틱 후기입니다
                                        <i class="fas fa-image text-muted ml-1"></i>
                                        <span class="badge badge-danger ml-1">New</span>
                                        <span class="text-primary ml-1">[8]</span>
                                    </a>
                                </td>
                                <td>
                                    <div class="d-flex justify-content-center align-items-center">
                                        <img src="/resources/images/profile-2.jpg" class="rounded-circle mr-2" style="width: 24px; height: 24px;">
                                        박승민
                                    </div>
                                </td>
                                <td>2024.01.30</td>
                                <td>89</td>
                                <td>12</td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr>
                                <td>24</td>
                                <td>
                                    <a href="#" class="text-dark text-left d-block">
                                        다음 주 북한산 등반하실 분 계신가요?
                                        <span class="text-primary ml-1">[15]</span>
                                    </a>
                                </td>
                                <td>
                                    <div class="d-flex justify-content-center align-items-center">
                                        <img src="/resources/images/profile-3.jpg" class="rounded-circle mr-2" style="width: 24px; height: 24px;">
                                        박승민
                                    </div>
                                </td>
                                <td>2024.01.29</td>
                                <td>156</td>
                                <td>5</td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr>
                                <td>23</td>
                                <td>
                                    <a href="#" class="text-dark text-left d-block">
                                        겨울 등산 필수 장비 추천해주세요
                                        <span class="text-primary ml-1">[32]</span>
                                    </a>
                                </td>
                                <td>
                                    <div class="d-flex justify-content-center align-items-center">
                                        <img src="/resources/images/profile-4.jpg" class="rounded-circle mr-2" style="width: 24px; height: 24px;">
                                        박승민
                                    </div>
                                </td>
                                <td>2024.01.28</td>
                                <td>245</td>
                                <td>18</td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr>
                                <td>22</td>
                                <td>
                                    <a href="#" class="text-dark text-left d-block">
                                        등산화 사이즈 문의드립니다
                                        <span class="text-primary ml-1">[6]</span>
                                    </a>
                                </td>
                                <td>
                                    <div class="d-flex justify-content-center align-items-center">
                                        <img src="/resources/images/profile-5.jpg" class="rounded-circle mr-2" style="width: 24px; height: 24px;">
                                        박승민
