                                <td>
                                    <a href="#" class="text-dark text-left d-block">
                                        [일정공유] 주말 도봉산 산행 가실 분~
                                        <span class="text-primary ml-1">[11]</span>
                                    </a>
                                </td>
                                <td>
                                    <div class="d-flex justify-content-center align-items-center">
                                        <img src="/resources/images/profile-6.jpg" class="rounded-circle mr-2" style="width: 24px; height: 24px;">
                                        박승민
                                    </div>
                                </td>
                                <td>2024.01.26</td>
                                <td>167</td>
                                <td>8</td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr>
                                <td>20</td>
                                <td>
                                    <a href="#" class="text-dark text-left d-block">
                                        등산용 카메라 추천 부탁드립니다
                                        <i class="fas fa-image text-muted ml-1"></i>
                                        <span class="text-primary ml-1">[19]</span>
                                    </a>
                                </td>
                                <td>
                                    <div class="d-flex justify-content-center align-items-center">
                                        <img src="/resources/images/profile-7.jpg" class="rounded-circle mr-2" style="width: 24px; height: 24px;">
                                        박승민
                                    </div>
